{
  "_margins": "Set from every baseline run of 2026-11-17 and 2026-11-18 (docs/fork/baseline/README.md) on a shared workstation. Memory +15% over the highest baseline run; boot time +50%; search latency x2; capture throughput floor at 50% of the lowest run; recall floors at baseline minus 0.02; graph cases and index document counts may not drop at all. Each memory or time ceiling is paired with the recall and index floors, so a change that saves memory by doing less work fails. Lower a ceiling when a later build improves on it.",
